# Nipange mobile — environment variables
# The app currently ships no runtime secrets: the API base URL lives in
# src/lib/theme.ts (BASE) and public OAuth client IDs in app.json → extra.
# If a real env var is introduced, add the key here with a placeholder only —
# never commit real values.
#
# CI/build secrets (GitHub repo settings, not this file):
#   EXPO_TOKEN        — Expo access token, https://expo.dev/settings/access-tokens
#   APPLE_TEAM_ID     — Apple Developer team ID (iOS builds)
#   EXPO_ASC_API_KEY_PATH / EXPO_ASC_KEY_ID / EXPO_ASC_ISSUER_ID — App Store Connect (iOS submit)

# API_BASE_URL=https://nipange.co.ke
